# Vercel AI Gateway — one key, every model in lib/models.ts.
# Create one at https://vercel.com/ai-gateway
AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY=

# Signs tool approvals so a client cannot forge one. Optional while the tools
# in lib/tools.ts are stubs; required the moment one of them spends money,
# posts something, or touches production — without it, the "approved" flag
# coming back from a browser is only a claim.
#   openssl rand -base64 32
TOOL_APPROVAL_SECRET=

# To use a provider directly instead, install its package
# (e.g. `npm i @ai-sdk/anthropic`) and swap the `model` line in
# lib/runner.ts. Nothing else in the template changes.
